  "details": "The new sdk pickups behave differently on vive wands (relative to previous sdk versions)\n\nIn the video provided, I'm using the trigger to try to transfer a pickup between my hands, it often gets dropped during a transfer. It's not on par with previous pickup versions and it makes pickups very unintuitive to use\n\nAmong all the new pickup types (across 1.0 and 1.1) only one type does not randomly drop out of the hands on vive wands when picking it up, that being pickups set to 1.0 with Auto Hold's \"Sometimes\" setting\n\nI can't control what worlds upload their pickup types as, using the new pickup types is painful on vive and the behaviour is new to pickups. They regularly drop during transfers between hands or during initial pickup events if some internal state disagrees with me wanting to auto hold it\n\nThis is with the trigger acting as both InputUse and InputGrab (a typical vive setup as far as I'm aware)",
